   "n_markup": 6,
   "text": "## Personal protective equipment\n\n- Safety goggles must be worn at all times while anyone in the room is working with chemicals.\n- Lab coats must be knee-length and fully buttoned.\n- Nitrile gloves are standard. Use the thicker butyl gloves (green box) when handling concentrated acids.\n- Closed shoes are required; sandals are never allowed.\n\n"
  },
